# Render Static Site Redirect Rules
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
# react-snap pre-renders each public route into dist/<route>/index.html
# _redirects rewrites clean URLs to the index.html inside each directory.
# Render serves dist/<route>/index.html with Content-Type: text/html (correct!)
#
# DO NOT use flat extensionless files (dist/terms, dist/privacy-policy etc.)
# Render serves those as Content-Type: binary/octet-stream, causing browser downloads.
#
# DO NOT rewrite to dist/<route>.html for public routes — same octet-stream issue.
# Rewrite to /<route>/index.html so Render serves the HTML file with text/html.
#
# SPA private routes (/dashboard, /settings, /admin etc.) continue to use the
# /* /index.html 200 catch-all fallback.

/terms /terms/index.html 200!
/terms/ /terms/index.html 200!
/privacy-policy /privacy-policy/index.html 200!
/privacy-policy/ /privacy-policy/index.html 200!
/refund-policy /refund-policy/index.html 200!
/refund-policy/ /refund-policy/index.html 200!
/features /features/index.html 200!
/features/ /features/index.html 200!
/pricing /pricing/index.html 200!
/pricing/ /pricing/index.html 200!
/security /security/index.html 200!
/security/ /security/index.html 200!
/contact-sales /contact-sales/index.html 200!
/contact-sales/ /contact-sales/index.html 200!
/blog /blog/index.html 200!
/blog/ /blog/index.html 200!
/* /index.html 200